---
import {topics,asset} from '../../data/design-preview';
const topicImages=['b3cb4.png','6964c.png','70fde.png'];
---
<form class="cooperation-form" data-preview-form>
<fieldset class="topic-fieldset"><legend><small>01</small> 你想拍什麼？</legend><p class="muted">本期拍攝主題，可複選；也歡迎提出自己的想法。</p>
<div class="topic-grid">{topics.map((topic,i)=><label class="topic-card"><img src={asset(topicImages[Math.min(i,topicImages.length-1)])} width="390" height="520" alt={topic+'概念照片'} loading="lazy"/><span>{topic}<input type="checkbox" name="topic" value={topic}/></span></label>)}</div>
<label class="other-topic">我想拍其他主題<input type="checkbox" name="topic" value="其他主題"/></label></fieldset>
<div class="form-columns">
<fieldset class="calendar-panel"><legend><small>02</small> 開放檔期</legend><div class="month-tabs" role="group" aria-label="切換月份" data-month-tabs></div><h3 class="calendar-title" data-month-title></h3><div class="calendar-week" aria-hidden="true">{['一','二','三','四','五','六','日'].map(x=><span>{x}</span>)}</div><div class="calendar-days" data-calendar></div><p class="calendar-note">日期為預覽示意，送出後再討論確認。</p>
<div class="date-summary"><p class="date-summary__label">偏好日期（選填）</p><div class="date-chips" data-dates aria-live="polite"><span class="date-chips__empty">尚未選擇日期</span></div></div></fieldset>
<div class="form-details">
<fieldset><legend><small>03</small> 參考與想法</legend>
<div class="field"><span class="field-label">參考照片 / 連結<em>選填</em></span><label class="upload-box"><input type="file" name="references" accept="image/jpeg,image/png,image/webp" multiple data-files aria-label="參考照片（選填）"/></label><small data-file-status>最多 3 張 JPG、PNG 或 WebP，每張 4 MB；照片僅在此瀏覽器中預覽。</small></div>
<label class="field"><span class="field-label">拍攝想法<em>選填</em></span><textarea name="idea" maxlength="2000" rows="4" placeholder="想拍攝的氛圍、地點，或任何浮現在腦海裡的畫面…" data-idea></textarea><small data-idea-count>最多 2,000 字　·　0 / 2,000</small></label></fieldset>
<fieldset><legend><small>04</small> 合作資訊</legend><div class="contact-fields"><label>姓名／暱稱<input name="name" autocomplete="name" required placeholder="請輸入暱稱"/></label><label>合作類型<select name="type" aria-label="合作類型" required><option value="">請選擇</option><option>一般互惠</option><option>主題企劃</option></select></label><label>聯絡方式<select name="contactMethod" aria-label="聯絡方式" required><option value="">請選擇</option><option>Instagram</option><option>Email</option></select></label><label>聯絡帳號／連結<input name="contact" required placeholder="輸入帳號或連結"/></label></div></fieldset>
<button class="submit-button" type="submit">確認合作內容</button><p class="muted form-note">本機預覽：資料不會送出，也不會成立預約。</p><section class="form-summary" data-summary hidden aria-live="polite"><h3>確認你的合作意向</h3><p data-summary-text></p><button type="button" data-edit>返回修改</button><a class="pill" href="https://forms.gle/8V17E3gPVf3NdEaY8" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">填寫合作意向</a><small>正式表單會另開視窗，需重新填寫。</small></section></div></div></form>
